Z||000006||BENGAL4||04-15-2001||08:51 PM||||Hey Bat,<P>Nice to see a post from one of the charter members. Rough winter here, but my swap should be finished any day now. LOL. Nice to see the famous Batmobile again.<P>Bill||||reg||10
Z||000007||batboy||04-15-2001||09:15 PM||||Bengal buddy! You ain't a kidding about it being a long and crappy winter. If I remember right, you're installing a 3800 V6 in your beast, right. I have a 3800 in my 98 Grand Prix and really I love it. Has to be the best V6 made in the U.S.A. Are you going supercharged?||||reg||1
Z||000008||BENGAL4||04-16-2001||09:40 PM||||Hey Bat,<P>Yes it will be supercharged. Didn't here from the shop doing the work today. Having ECM problems. Seems the newer,(97 and up),are alot harder to bypass sensors. Hence the computer thinks the car is being stolen so it shuts the engine off. They are putting a 95 ECM in it and this should solve the problem. LOL. I will be posting pics when it is finished. <P>Bill||||reg||1
